  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Added support for `.OnFailureAsync(...)` to execute logic after the final failed attempt.\n\t\t\t- `RetryBuilder` extended with `.OnFailureAsync(...)` for fluent failure hook configuration.\n\t\t\t- Hook receives `RetryContext` with details of the last failed attempt.\n\t\t\t- Added internal error handling for exceptions thrown inside the failure hook.\n\t\t\t- Unit tests added to ensure failure hook execution and resilience.",
